<title>CANADA: Canada grain body details flax quality.</title>
<headline>Canada grain body details flax quality.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Grain Commission on Monday detailed preliminary flax oil and protein content quality for the 1996 harvest.</p>
<p>1996 Harvest  Oil (pct) Protein (pct) Iodine (g/100 g)</p>
<p>Grade Samples Mean Avg  Mean Avg	Mean Avg</p>
<p>Manitoba</p>
<p>No1 C  87     43.7	22.8	    191.9</p>
<p>Saskatchewan</p>
<p>No1 C  77     44.7	21.3	    194.0</p>
<p>Alberta</p>
<p>No1 C   1     46.9	18.0	    191.9</p>
<p>Western Canada</p>
<p>No1 C 165     44.2	22.1	    192.9</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
